    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="structthemis_1_1_hyperedge" kindref="compound">Hyperedge</ref>: Connects multiple nodes simultaneously. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Used for:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>AND-joins (wait for all incoming paths)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>AND-splits (activate all outgoing paths)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Complex synchronization patterns</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Unlike regular edges (1:1), hyperedges are (N:M):<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Multiple source nodes</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Multiple target nodes</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Single synchronization point </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
